; The standalone Sift ppx — for libraries that DON'T use the fur/MLX ppx. Registers the shared rules
; from fennec.pulse.sift.ppx.rules so [@@deriving sift] / [@@deriving model] work. Libraries on
; (pps fennec.fur.ppx) get them for free (fur.ppx links the same rules), so they don't list this.
(library
 (name sift_ppx)
 (public_name fennec.pulse.sift.ppx)
 (kind ppx_rewriter)
 (libraries sift_ppx_rules ppxlib))
